sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant IS as InteractiveSession
    participant MR as MentionResolver
    participant Agent as ReActAgent
    participant Bridge as McpToolBridge
    participant Client as McpClient
    participant RPC as JsonRpcClient
    participant Trans as McpTransport
    participant Disp as NotificationDispatcher
    participant Pres as TerminalNotificationPresenter
    participant Out as ReplReader.printAsync

    Note over User,Out: 场景 A — REPL 用户输入 @path 触发工具调用（P0-1 + P0-2 + P1-3）
    User->>IS: 输入 "帮我看 @src/main/App.java 的 main"
    IS->>MR: resolve(line)  // 自由文本解析, 内联文件内容
    IS->>Agent: run(resolved)
    Agent->>Bridge: execute(args)  // 模型生成参数字符串可能含 @path
    Bridge->>Client: callTool(name, argumentsJson)
    Client->>MR: resolveJson(argumentsJson)  // 遍历 JSON 字符串叶子做 @mention 解析 (覆盖 P1-3)
    Client->>RPC: request("tools/call", params)
    RPC->>Trans: send(tools/call)
    Trans-->>RPC: 响应 (id 非空)
    RPC-->>Client: 结果文本
    Client-->>Bridge: 结果
    Bridge-->>Agent: 结果
    Agent-->>IS: 回复
    IS-->>User: 展示

---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Server as McpServer
    participant Trans as McpTransport
    participant RPC as JsonRpcClient
    participant Disp as NotificationDispatcher
    participant Pres as TerminalNotificationPresenter
    participant Out as ReplReader.printAsync

    Note over Server,Out: 场景 B — server 推送 window/logMessage 被终端展示（P0-3 + P0-4）
    Server->>Trans: 入站消息 (无 id, method=window/logMessage, params.level=info)
    Trans->>RPC: handleMessage (经 onReceive 监听; stdio reader线程 / http 请求线程)
    RPC->>Disp: accept(notification)  // id==null -> 遍历 onNotification 监听器
    Disp->>Disp: parse -> NotificationRecord(level=INFO, message=...)
    Disp->>Pres: show(record)
    Pres->>Pres: 级别过滤(enabled 含 INFO) + 非 PROGRESS 即时
    Pres->>Out: printer.accept(format(record))
    Out->>Out: println + flush (不抢占 REPL 输入)
    Note right of Out: 终端打印: [mcp:github] info   rate limit remaining: 4999

---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant IS as InteractiveSession
    participant Client as McpClient
    participant MR as MentionResolver
    participant RPC as JsonRpcClient
    participant Trans as McpTransport

    Note over User,Trans: 场景 C — server 不发通知时正常调用（降级兼容）
    User->>IS: 输入不含 @mention 的自然语言
    IS->>Client: callTool(name, argumentsJson)  // 无 @mention
    Client->>MR: resolveJson(argumentsJson)
    alt mentionResolver==null 或 无 @token
        MR-->>Client: 原文不变 (与改造前逐字节一致)
    end
    Client->>RPC: request("tools/call", params)
    Trans-->>RPC: 响应
    RPC-->>Client: 结果
    Note over RPC: notificationListeners 为空 -> 无通知处理, 零额外开销/异常
    Client-->>IS: 结果文本
    IS-->>User: 展示 (无额外输出/无异常)
